    'company.tsc.overview.p1': "TSC.ai builds intelligence platforms for some of the world's largest organizations Fortune 500 companies and NGOs operating across 95 countries. When I joined, there was no product design function, no design system, and no team.",
    'company.tsc.overview.p2': 'As the design lead, my focus was the UX/UI: translating product requirements into user-tested interfaces, building the design system from scratch, and maintaining design quality from early concepts through to production. I worked alongside PM and Engineering throughout.',
    'company.tsc.contrib.1.headline': 'Designed Genie from zero to production',
