    // Works page subtitles
    'work.genie-platform.subtitle': 'When I joined TSC Labs, Genie was a product concept. I spent two years turning it into a complete enterprise platform designing every surface, every system, and every decision about what the product was trying to do and for whom.',
    'work.genie-networks.subtitle': 'I built the Network feature for Genie from scratch a visual canvas that lets enterprise communications teams map how their stakeholders relate to each other, discover connection paths, and move from raw data to relationship insight without leaving the platform.',
    'work.genie-notes.subtitle': 'I identified a fragmentation problem that was costing engagement teams hours of manual work per session, and designed an integrated system that connected handwritten notes, AI-generated analysis, and exportable context into one coherent layer on the stakeholder profile.',
    'work.great2know.subtitle': 'great2know came to me with a product concept and a clear organisational pain: when people leave or move roles, the institutional knowledge they carry walks out with them. I designed the end-to-end product experience for a SaaS platform that captures, structures, and transfers that knowledge before it disappears.',
    'work.tiki-aging.subtitle': "Sellers on Tiki's marketplace were losing money to slow-moving inventory they couldn't see clearly. I designed the Aging Inventory Report a data visualisation and analytics tool that turned raw stock data into actionable decisions, in one month.",
    'work.opinew-website.subtitle': "After defining Opinew's brand identity in a previous engagement, I returned to apply it redesigning the actual website from structure to visual execution. The brief: translate the new brand system into a site that communicated trust immediately, reduced early drop-off, and gave prospects a reason to explore rather than bounce.",
    'work.opinew-rebrand.subtitle': 'Refreshing the visual identity and messaging strategy for Opinew, a UK-based review management SaaS creating a brand that communicates transparency, trustworthiness, and growth to e-commerce businesses.',
    'work.my-balance.subtitle': "Redesigning the financial management experience for sellers on Tiki, one of Vietnam's largest e-commerce platforms unifying fragmented balances, enabling instant withdrawals, and eliminating a 7-day manual process.",
    'work.gempages.subtitle': 'Leading the end-to-end redesign of GemPages Editor for 5,000+ Shopify merchants restructuring navigation, streamlining key workflows, and shipping a long-requested dark mode in 90 days.',
    'work.dose-diary.subtitle': "Dose Diary started as a weekend project born from real necessity managing my wife's post-transplant immunosuppressant schedule and my own hormone therapy. When I couldn't find an app that handled complex schedules, lab tracking, and dialysis sessions without demanding cloud accounts or subscriptions, I designed and built one myself.",
    'work.wordpopi.subtitle': 'WordPopi is an iOS vocabulary learning app I designed and built end-to-end supporting English, Korean, and Thai with four distinct study modes, real-time Wi-Fi multiplayer battles, OCR-based deck creation, and fully offline operation. The goal: make serious language study sustainable through variety, competition, and zero friction.',
    'work.weallnet.subtitle': 'Weallnet is a Vietnamese platform combining news, entertainment, chat, and promotional content. When I joined for a 3-month engagement, the app was losing users to content overload and navigation confusion. I redesigned the information architecture and content experience from the ground up keeping the editorial depth while making it navigable.',
    'work.kreebox-crypto.subtitle': 'Kreebox needed a product design for a crypto lending and borrowing platform targeting Southeast Asian users one that served both newcomers and experienced DeFi traders without compromising either. In three weeks, I designed the full app experience: from collateral management and loan origination to interest dashboards and risk controls.',
    'work.delivery-app.subtitle': 'Designing a mobile platform for cold storage operators in South Korea to monitor temperatures in real time, manage inventory across locations, and ensure regulatory compliance replacing fragmented manual processes end-to-end.',

