    'now.outside.p2': "Outside of design, I spend a lot of time exploring AI agentic workflows not just using AI tools but building pipelines that actually automate the tedious parts of how I work. I'm also genuinely interested in data and coding. Understanding how data models are structured and how code actually gets built makes me a sharper designer I can make decisions that hold up when they hit engineering, not just when they're still pixels in Figma.",

