    'work.genie-platform.pullquote.1': 'The platform had to work as a continuous intelligence system, not a series of point-in-time reports. Every design decision was evaluated against that: does this help users build an ongoing picture, or does it produce a snapshot that goes stale?',
    'work.genie-platform.pullquote.2': '"What began as a centralised ESG intelligence platform has become the operational backbone for the global sustainable development function."',

