    'work.genie-networks.pullquote.1': 'Every time a team needed to think relationally, they had to rebuild that picture manually from scratch. It was slow, it was fragile, and it broke the moment a stakeholder changed roles.',
    'work.genie-networks.goal.1': 'Let users build and explore a visual map of how their stakeholders connected',
    'work.genie-networks.goal.2': 'Every node had to be a live stakeholder profile clicking a node shows everything Genie knew about that person',
    'work.genie-networks.goal.3': 'Users needed to discover paths between any two people in their network',
    'work.genie-networks.goal.4': 'The whole thing had to be connected to the rest of the platform networks created from a stakeholder profile, an AI insight, or an engagement project, not only from a blank starting point',
    'work.genie-networks.pullquote.2': 'Within six months of launching Networks, we were already embedding the same graph engine in the stakeholder profile as a context widget. That wouldn\'t have been possible if the product features had been built directly into the canvas layer.',
    'work.genie-networks.caption.indexCanvas': 'Networks index grid view (left) and canvas editor with stakeholder node (right)',
